// M5-A3P-1014. Ch21 H09 "The Great Unbinding" (C, 2 min). act3_ending.md §2 H09, §0 rules 3, 6, 7.
// The last "tash". Every mote in Maresh is RELEASED in this one instant; everything after is ascent. Six cutaways, 3-4 s
// each, no people in close-up, no goodbyes: Iskarra's lamp-columns go dark; a Hollowmere tide-wheel stops; the Tamsule
// Bell's light leaves it; the Sanctum's mirror basin goes dark and ripples for the first time in four hundred years;
// Lowlight's conduits empty upward; the storm wall comes apart into rising light. Then the Kite, last wide: its lamps
// go dark in the same instant as everything else, its engines stop, and it rides the last updraft into open night on
// sail alone, unlit (Tobin's lamp in its socket goes with it). `unbinding_swell`: the only full choir and orchestra.
title: ch21_great_unbinding
location: ch21/heart
---
@letterbox on
@music unbinding_swell fade=0.5
@camera HT16
@vfx glimmer_lift at=iskarra_columns count=80 motion=spiral_up rate=fast
@wait 3.5
@camera HT17
@vfx glimmer_lift at=tide_wheel count=20 motion=spiral_up rate=fast
@wait 3.5
@camera HT18
@vfx glimmer_lift at=tamsule_bell count=40 motion=spiral_up rate=fast
@wait 3.5
@camera HT19
@vfx glimmer_lift at=sanctum_basin count=40 motion=spiral_up rate=fast
@wait 3.5
@camera HT20
@vfx glimmer_lift at=lowlight_conduits count=40 motion=spiral_up rate=fast
@wait 3.5
@camera HT21
@vfx glimmer_lift at=storm_wall count=400 motion=spiral_up rate=fast
@wait 4.0
@camera HT22
@vfx glimmer_lift at=kite_lamps count=6 motion=spiral_up rate=fast
@sfx kite_engines_stop
@wait 8.0
<<set $ch21_unbound = true>>
@fade out 3.0
@letterbox off
===
